.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sort 1  "sort " 
.SH NAME
sort \- Sort local files by discovery criteria
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsort\fR [\fB\-\-by\fR] [\fB\-\-min\-seeders\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-seeders\fR] [\fB\-\-niche\fR] [\fB\-\-frecency\-weight\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\-size\fR] [\fB\-\-threads\fR] [\fB\-\-enrich\fR] [\fB\-\-local\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-path\-prefix\fR] [\fB\-\-path\-glob\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-enrich\fR] [\fB\-\-remote\-only\fR] [\fB\-e\fR|\fB\-\-ext\fR] [\fB\-\-size\fR] [\fB\-\-depth\fR] [\fB\-\-min\-depth\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-depth\fR] [\fB\-\-type\fR] [\fB\-\-modified\-within\fR] [\fB\-\-modified\-before\fR] [\fB\-\-time\-modified\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPATH\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sort local files by discovery criteria
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-by\fR \fI<BY>\fR [default: niche]

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
niche
.IP \(bu 2
frecency
.IP \(bu 2
peers
.IP \(bu 2
random
.IP \(bu 2
folder
.IP \(bu 2
time
.IP \(bu 2
date
.IP \(bu 2
week
.IP \(bu 2
month
.IP \(bu 2
year
.IP \(bu 2
size
.IP \(bu 2
folder\-size
.IP \(bu 2
folder\-avg\-size
.IP \(bu 2
folder\-date
.IP \(bu 2
folder\-time
.IP \(bu 2
count
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-min\-seeders\fR \fI<MIN_SEEDERS>\fR
Filter files with fewer than N seeders
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-seeders\fR \fI<MAX_SEEDERS>\fR
Filter files with more than N seeders
.TP
\fB\-\-niche\fR \fI<NICHE>\fR
Ideal popularity (peer count) for niche scoring
.TP
\fB\-\-frecency\-weight\fR \fI<FRECENCY_WEIGHT>\fR
Divisor for recency weighting in frecency calculation
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\-size\fR \fI<LIMIT_SIZE>\fR
Quit after printing N bytes of files
.TP
\fB\-\-threads\fR \fI<THREADS>\fR [default: 0]
Scanner threads (1 disables parallelism, 0 uses all available CPUs)
.TP
\fB\-\-enrich\fR
Query daemon for peer counts and frequency data to enrich niche/frecency/peers sorting
.TP
\fB\-\-local\-only\fR
Scan the local disk instead of the metadata index (works on any path, even outside a Syncweb folder)
.TP
\fB\-\-path\-prefix\fR \fI<PATH_PREFIX>\fR
Only entries whose path starts with this prefix
.TP
\fB\-\-path\-glob\fR \fI<PATH_GLOB>\fR
Only entries whose path matches this glob pattern
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-enrich\fR
Skip per\-file disk metadata lookup (pure metadata listing)
.TP
\fB\-\-remote\-only\fR
Show only entries not yet downloaded (State == remote)
.TP
\fB\-e\fR, \fB\-\-ext\fR \fI<EXT>\fR
File extensions to include (can repeat)
.TP
\fB\-\-size\fR \fI<SIZE>\fR
Size constraints: N, \-N, +N, N%10, +5GB, etc. (can repeat)
.TP
\fB\-\-depth\fR \fI<DEPTH>\fR
Depth constraints: N, +N (min), \-N (max) (can repeat)
.TP
\fB\-\-min\-depth\fR \fI<MIN_DEPTH>\fR
Alternative min depth notation
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-depth\fR \fI<MAX_DEPTH>\fR
Alternative max depth notation
.TP
\fB\-\-type\fR \fI<FILE_TYPE>\fR
Filter by type: f=file, d=dir, l=symlink
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
f
.IP \(bu 2
d
.IP \(bu 2
l
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-modified\-within\fR \fI<MODIFIED_WITHIN>\fR
Newer than: \*(Aq3 days\*(Aq, \*(Aq2 weeks\*(Aq (can repeat)
.TP
\fB\-\-modified\-before\fR \fI<MODIFIED_BEFORE>\fR
Older than: \*(Aq3 years\*(Aq, \*(Aq1 month\*(Aq (can repeat)
.TP
\fB\-\-time\-modified\fR \fI<TIME_MODIFIED>\fR
Time modified: \*(Aq\-3 days\*(Aq (newer), \*(Aq+3 days\*(Aq (older) (can repeat)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPATH\fR] [default: .]

